- A service (`AppService`) that extracts text files from the zip and concatenates their contents.
- The main application module (`AppModule`) that sets up the necessary components.
- A basic test file for the controller.

To run the application, use the command `npm run start`, and it will start a web server on `http://0.0.0.0:5000`. You can then test the API by sending a POST request to `/convert` with a zip file containing text files.
